{"seq":3,"slug":"json-semi-structured","title":"JSON 与半结构化数据","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/sql-language/analytical-sql/json-semi-structured","wordCount":697,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"json-与半结构化数据\">JSON 与半结构化数据</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>现代关系数据库不再局限于严格的表结构。JSON/JSONB 数据类型让 SQL 数据库能够处理半结构化数据，在关系模型的强一致性和 NoSQL 的灵活性之间取得平衡。PostgreSQL 的 JSONB 是这一领域的标杆，提供了完整的查询、索引和操作符支持。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[半结构化数据] --&gt; B{选择存储方式}&#10;    B --&gt;|结构固定| C[关系表列]&#10;    B --&gt;|结构多变| D[JSONB 列]&#10;    B --&gt;|嵌套深/查询少| E[TEXT/BLOB]&#10;&#10;    D --&gt; F[GIN 索引]&#10;    D --&gt; G[表达式索引]&#10;&#10;    subgraph JSONB 操作&#10;        H[路径查询 -&gt;&gt;, #&gt;&gt;]&#10;        I[包含检查 @&gt;]&#10;        J[存在检查 ?]&#10;        K[修改操作 jsonb_set]&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    A[半结构化数据] --&gt; B{选择存储方式}\n    B --&gt;|结构固定| C[关系表列]\n    B --&gt;|结构多变| D[JSONB 列]\n    B --&gt;|嵌套深/查询少| E[TEXT/BLOB]\n\n    D --&gt; F[GIN 索引]\n    D --&gt; G[表达式索引]\n\n    subgraph JSONB 操作\n        H[路径查询 -&gt;&gt;, #&gt;&gt;]\n        I[包含检查 @&gt;]\n        J[存在检查 ?]\n        K[修改操作 jsonb_set]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>数据类型</th>\n<th>存储格式</th>\n<th>查询性能</th>\n<th>索引支持</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>JSON</td>\n<td>文本原样存储</td>\n<td>每次解析</td>\n<td>表达式索引</td>\n<td>存日志、少查询</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>JSONB</td>\n<td>二进制分解存储</td>\n<td>直接查询</td>\n<td>GIN / 表达式</td>\n<td>频繁查询和过滤</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TEXT</td>\n<td>纯文本</td>\n<td>无结构化查询</td>\n<td>全文索引</td>\n<td>原始数据存档</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"jsonb-查询操作符\">JSONB 查询操作符</h2><p>PostgreSQL 提供了丰富的 JSONB 操作符，支持路径导航、类型提取和包含检查。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const jsonbOperators = `&#10;-- 示例数据&#10;CREATE TABLE products (&#10;    product_id BIGINT GENERATED ALWAYS AS IDENTITY PRIMARY KEY,&#10;    name VARCHAR(200),&#10;    attributes JSONB NOT NULL DEFAULT &#39;{}&#39;&#10;);&#10;&#10;INSERT INTO products (name, attributes) VALUES&#10;(&#39;MacBook Pro&#39;, &#39;{&#10;    &quot;brand&quot;: &quot;Apple&quot;,&#10;    &quot;specs&quot;: {&quot;cpu&quot;: &quot;M3&quot;, &quot;ram&quot;: 16, &quot;storage&quot;: 512},&#10;    &quot;tags&quot;: [&quot;laptop&quot;, &quot;pro&quot;, &quot;portable&quot;],&#10;    &quot;price&quot;: {&quot;amount&quot;: 12999, &quot;currency&quot;: &quot;CNY&quot;}&#10;}&#39;);&#10;&#10;-- -&gt; 返回 JSON 对象&#10;SELECT attributes-&gt;&#39;specs&#39; FROM products;&#10;-- 返回: {&quot;cpu&quot;: &quot;M3&quot;, &quot;ram&quot;: 16, &quot;storage&quot;: 512}&#10;&#10;-- -&gt;&gt; 返回 TEXT&#10;SELECT attributes-&gt;&gt;&#39;brand&#39; FROM products;&#10;-- 返回: Apple&#10;&#10;-- #&gt; 和 #&gt;&gt; 路径导航&#10;SELECT attributes#&gt;&#39;{specs,cpu}&#39; FROM products;     -- 返回: &quot;M3&quot;（JSON）&#10;SELECT attributes#&gt;&gt;&#39;{specs,cpu}&#39; FROM products;    -- 返回: M3（TEXT）&#10;&#10;-- @&gt; 包含检查（左侧是否包含右侧）&#10;SELECT * FROM products &#10;WHERE attributes @&gt; &#39;{&quot;brand&quot;: &quot;Apple&quot;}&#39;;&#10;&#10;-- ? 键存在检查&#10;SELECT * FROM products &#10;WHERE attributes ? &#39;brand&#39;;&#10;&#10;-- ?| 任一键存在&#10;SELECT * FROM products &#10;WHERE attributes ?| array[&#39;brand&#39;, &#39;manufacturer&#39;];&#10;&#10;-- ?&amp; 所有键存在&#10;SELECT * FROM products &#10;WHERE attributes ?&amp; array[&#39;brand&#39;, &#39;specs&#39;];&#10;`;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> jsonbOperators</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 示例数据</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">CREATE TABLE products (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    product_id BIGINT GENERATED ALWAYS AS IDENTITY PRIMARY KEY,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    name VARCHAR(200),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    attributes JSONB NOT NULL DEFAULT '{}'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">INSERT INTO products (name, attributes) VALUES</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">('MacBook Pro', '{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"brand\": \"Apple\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"specs\": {\"cpu\": \"M3\", \"ram\": 16, \"storage\": 512},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"tags\": [\"laptop\", \"pro\", \"portable\"],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"price\": {\"amount\": 12999, \"currency\": \"CNY\"}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- -> 返回 JSON 对象</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT attributes->'specs' FROM products;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 返回: {\"cpu\": \"M3\", \"ram\": 16, \"storage\": 512}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- ->> 返回 TEXT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT attributes->>'brand' FROM products;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 返回: Apple</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- #> 和 #>> 路径导航</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT attributes#>'{specs,cpu}' FROM products;     -- 返回: \"M3\"（JSON）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT attributes#>>'{specs,cpu}' FROM products;    -- 返回: M3（TEXT）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- @> 包含检查（左侧是否包含右侧）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT * FROM products </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">WHERE attributes @> '{\"brand\": \"Apple\"}';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- ? 键存在检查</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT * FROM products </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">WHERE attributes ? 'brand';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- ?| 任一键存在</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT * FROM products </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">WHERE attributes ?| array['brand', 'manufacturer'];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- ?&#x26; 所有键存在</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT * FROM products </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">WHERE attributes ?&#x26; array['brand', 'specs'];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>操作符</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n<th>返回类型</th>\n<th>可用索引</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>-&gt;</td>\n<td>按键取值</td>\n<td>JSONB</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-&gt;&gt;</td>\n<td>按键取值</td>\n<td>TEXT</td>\n<td>表达式索引</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>#&gt;</td>\n<td>路径取值</td>\n<td>JSONB</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>#&gt;&gt;</td>\n<td>路径取值</td>\n<td>TEXT</td>\n<td>表达式索引</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>@&gt;</td>\n<td>包含</td>\n<td>BOOLEAN</td>\n<td>GIN</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>?</td>\n<td>键存在</td>\n<td>BOOLEAN</td>\n<td>GIN</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>||</td>\n<td>合并</td>\n<td>JSONB</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>删除键</td>\n<td>JSONB</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"jsonb-索引策略\">JSONB 索引策略</h2><p>JSONB 的查询性能依赖正确的索引策略。GIN 索引支持通用的包含和存在查询，表达式索引支持特定路径的精确查询。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const jsonbIndexing = `&#10;-- GIN 索引：支持 @&gt;, ?, ?| 等操作符&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_product_attrs ON products USING GIN (attributes);&#10;&#10;-- 查询示例（利用 GIN 索引）&#10;SELECT * FROM products WHERE attributes @&gt; &#39;{&quot;brand&quot;: &quot;Apple&quot;}&#39;;&#10;SELECT * FROM products WHERE attributes ? &#39;warranty&#39;;&#10;&#10;-- GIN jsonb_path_ops：更小的索引，只支持 @&gt;&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_attrs_pathops ON products &#10;    USING GIN (attributes jsonb_path_ops);&#10;&#10;-- 表达式索引：针对特定路径的精确查询&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_brand ON products ((attributes-&gt;&gt;&#39;brand&#39;));&#10;SELECT * FROM products WHERE attributes-&gt;&gt;&#39;brand&#39; = &#39;Apple&#39;;&#10;&#10;-- 数值路径索引（需要类型转换）&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_ram ON products (((attributes#&gt;&gt;&#39;{specs,ram}&#39;)::INT));&#10;SELECT * FROM products WHERE (attributes#&gt;&gt;&#39;{specs,ram}&#39;)::INT &gt;= 16;&#10;&#10;-- 部分索引 + JSONB&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_laptop_tags ON products USING GIN (attributes)&#10;    WHERE attributes @&gt; &#39;{&quot;tags&quot;: [&quot;laptop&quot;]}&#39;;&#10;`;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> jsonbIndexing</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- GIN 索引：支持 @>, ?, ?| 等操作符</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">CREATE INDEX idx_product_attrs ON products USING GIN (attributes);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 查询示例（利用 GIN 索引）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT * FROM products WHERE attributes @> '{\"brand\": \"Apple\"}';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT * FROM products WHERE attributes ? 'warranty';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- GIN jsonb_path_ops：更小的索引，只支持 @></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">CREATE INDEX idx_attrs_pathops ON products </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    USING GIN (attributes jsonb_path_ops);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 表达式索引：针对特定路径的精确查询</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">CREATE INDEX idx_brand ON products ((attributes->>'brand'));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT * FROM products WHERE attributes->>'brand' = 'Apple';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 数值路径索引（需要类型转换）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">CREATE INDEX idx_ram ON products (((attributes#>>'{specs,ram}')::INT));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT * FROM products WHERE (attributes#>>'{specs,ram}')::INT >= 16;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 部分索引 + JSONB</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">CREATE INDEX idx_laptop_tags ON products USING GIN (attributes)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    WHERE attributes @> '{\"tags\": [\"laptop\"]}';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>索引方式</th>\n<th>支持的操作</th>\n<th>索引大小</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>GIN (default)</td>\n<td>@&gt;, ?, ?|, ?&amp;</td>\n<td>大</td>\n<td>通用 JSONB 查询</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GIN (jsonb_path_ops)</td>\n<td>仅 @&gt;</td>\n<td>小（约 1/3）</td>\n<td>只需要包含查询</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>表达式索引</td>\n<td>=, &lt;, &gt;, BETWEEN</td>\n<td>最小</td>\n<td>特定路径精确查询</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"jsonb-修改操作\">JSONB 修改操作</h2><p>JSONB 的修改不是原地更新，而是生成新的 JSONB 值。PostgreSQL 提供了多个函数来简化 JSONB 的修改操作。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const jsonbModification = `&#10;-- jsonb_set：设置指定路径的值&#10;UPDATE products&#10;SET attributes = jsonb_set(attributes, &#39;{specs,ram}&#39;, &#39;32&#39;)&#10;WHERE product_id = 1;&#10;&#10;-- 嵌套路径设置（create_if_missing 参数）&#10;UPDATE products&#10;SET attributes = jsonb_set(&#10;    attributes, &#10;    &#39;{warranty,years}&#39;, &#10;    &#39;3&#39;, &#10;    true  -- 路径不存在时创建&#10;)&#10;WHERE product_id = 1;&#10;&#10;-- || 合并操作&#10;UPDATE products&#10;SET attributes = attributes || &#39;{&quot;color&quot;: &quot;silver&quot;, &quot;weight&quot;: &quot;1.6kg&quot;}&#39;&#10;WHERE product_id = 1;&#10;&#10;-- - 删除键&#10;UPDATE products&#10;SET attributes = attributes - &#39;obsolete_field&#39;&#10;WHERE product_id = 1;&#10;&#10;-- #- 按路径删除&#10;UPDATE products&#10;SET attributes = attributes #- &#39;{specs,old_cpu}&#39;&#10;WHERE product_id = 1;&#10;&#10;-- 数组操作&#10;UPDATE products&#10;SET attributes = jsonb_set(&#10;    attributes,&#10;    &#39;{tags}&#39;,&#10;    (attributes-&gt;&#39;tags&#39;) || &#39;&quot;new-tag&quot;&#39;&#10;)&#10;WHERE product_id = 1;&#10;&#10;-- jsonb_strip_nulls：移除所有 null 值&#10;UPDATE products&#10;SET attributes = jsonb_strip_nulls(attributes)&#10;WHERE attributes @&gt; &#39;null&#39;;&#10;`;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> jsonbModification</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- jsonb_set：设置指定路径的值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">UPDATE products</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SET attributes = jsonb_set(attributes, '{specs,ram}', '32')</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">WHERE product_id = 1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 嵌套路径设置（create_if_missing 参数）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">UPDATE products</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SET attributes = jsonb_set(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    attributes, </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    '{warranty,years}', </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    '3', </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    true  -- 路径不存在时创建</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">WHERE product_id = 1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- || 合并操作</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">UPDATE products</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SET attributes = attributes || '{\"color\": \"silver\", \"weight\": \"1.6kg\"}'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">WHERE product_id = 1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- - 删除键</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">UPDATE products</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SET attributes = attributes - 'obsolete_field'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">WHERE product_id = 1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- #- 按路径删除</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">UPDATE products</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SET attributes = attributes #- '{specs,old_cpu}'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">WHERE product_id = 1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 数组操作</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">UPDATE products</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SET attributes = jsonb_set(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    attributes,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    '{tags}',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    (attributes->'tags') || '\"new-tag\"'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">WHERE product_id = 1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- jsonb_strip_nulls：移除所有 null 值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">UPDATE products</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SET attributes = jsonb_strip_nulls(attributes)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">WHERE attributes @> 'null';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"jsonb-聚合与分析\">JSONB 聚合与分析</h2><p>JSONB 数据可以展开为行进行聚合分析，也可以将行数据聚合为 JSONB 结构。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const jsonbAnalytics = `&#10;-- jsonb_each：展开为键值对&#10;SELECT p.name, kv.key, kv.value&#10;FROM products p, jsonb_each(p.attributes-&gt;&#39;specs&#39;) AS kv;&#10;&#10;-- jsonb_array_elements：展开数组&#10;SELECT p.name, tag.value AS tag&#10;FROM products p, jsonb_array_elements_text(p.attributes-&gt;&#39;tags&#39;) AS tag;&#10;&#10;-- 聚合：行数据转 JSONB&#10;SELECT jsonb_agg(&#10;    jsonb_build_object(&#39;id&#39;, product_id, &#39;name&#39;, name, &#39;price&#39;, price)&#10;) AS products_json&#10;FROM products&#10;WHERE category_id = 5;&#10;&#10;-- jsonb_object_agg：键值对聚合为对象&#10;SELECT jsonb_object_agg(setting_key, setting_value) AS settings&#10;FROM user_settings&#10;WHERE user_id = 1;&#10;&#10;-- 统计 JSONB 数组中的标签分布&#10;SELECT tag, COUNT(*) AS product_count&#10;FROM products, jsonb_array_elements_text(attributes-&gt;&#39;tags&#39;) AS tag&#10;GROUP BY tag&#10;ORDER BY product_count DESC;&#10;&#10;-- JSON Path 查询（PostgreSQL 12+）&#10;SELECT * FROM products&#10;WHERE jsonb_path_exists(attributes, &#39;$.specs.ram ? (@ &gt;= 16)&#39;);&#10;&#10;SELECT jsonb_path_query(attributes, &#39;$.tags[*]&#39;) AS tag&#10;FROM products;&#10;`;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> jsonbAnalytics</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- jsonb_each：展开为键值对</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT p.name, kv.key, kv.value</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM products p, jsonb_each(p.attributes->'specs') AS kv;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- jsonb_array_elements：展开数组</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT p.name, tag.value AS tag</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM products p, jsonb_array_elements_text(p.attributes->'tags') AS tag;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 聚合：行数据转 JSONB</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT jsonb_agg(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    jsonb_build_object('id', product_id, 'name', name, 'price', price)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">) AS products_json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM products</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">WHERE category_id = 5;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- jsonb_object_agg：键值对聚合为对象</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT jsonb_object_agg(setting_key, setting_value) AS settings</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM user_settings</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">WHERE user_id = 1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 统计 JSONB 数组中的标签分布</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT tag, COUNT(*) AS product_count</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM products, jsonb_array_elements_text(attributes->'tags') AS tag</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">GROUP BY tag</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ORDER BY product_count DESC;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- JSON Path 查询（PostgreSQL 12+）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT * FROM products</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">WHERE jsonb_path_exists(attributes, '$.specs.ram ? (@ >= 16)');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT jsonb_path_query(attributes, '$.tags[*]') AS tag</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM products;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[JSONB 数据] --&gt; B{操作方向}&#10;    B --&gt;|展开| C[jsonb_each / jsonb_array_elements]&#10;    B --&gt;|聚合| D[jsonb_agg / jsonb_object_agg]&#10;    B --&gt;|查询| E[JSON Path / @&gt; / -&gt;&gt;]&#10;&#10;    C --&gt; F[关系表格式]&#10;    D --&gt; G[JSONB 结构]&#10;    E --&gt; H[过滤结果]\">graph LR\n    A[JSONB 数据] --&gt; B{操作方向}\n    B --&gt;|展开| C[jsonb_each / jsonb_array_elements]\n    B --&gt;|聚合| D[jsonb_agg / jsonb_object_agg]\n    B --&gt;|查询| E[JSON Path / @&gt; / -&gt;&gt;]\n\n    C --&gt; F[关系表格式]\n    D --&gt; G[JSONB 结构]\n    E --&gt; H[过滤结果]</pre><p>选择何时使用 JSONB 而非关系表：当字段结构频繁变化（如商品属性）、不同行的字段集合差异大（如多态实体）、或需要存储第三方 API 响应时，JSONB 是更好的选择。但如果字段结构稳定且需要频繁聚合查询，关系表仍是首选。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>JSONB 以二进制分解格式存储，支持高效查询和索引，优于 JSON 文本格式</li>\n<li><code>-&gt;</code> 返回 JSONB，<code>-&gt;&gt;</code> 返回 TEXT，<code>@&gt;</code> 检查包含关系，<code>?</code> 检查键存在</li>\n<li>GIN 索引支持 @&gt; 和 ? 操作符，jsonb_path_ops 变体更小但只支持 @&gt;</li>\n<li>表达式索引针对特定路径的精确查询，是最精准高效的索引方式</li>\n<li>JSONB 修改通过 jsonb_set、|| 合并和 - 删除实现，本质是生成新值</li>\n<li>jsonb_each 和 jsonb_array_elements 将 JSONB 展开为行，jsonb_agg 将行聚合为 JSONB</li>\n<li>字段结构多变、多态实体适合 JSONB，结构稳定且需频繁聚合适合关系表</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"JSON 与半结构化数据","id":"json-与半结构化数据"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"JSONB 查询操作符","id":"jsonb-查询操作符"},{"level":2,"text":"JSONB 索引策略","id":"jsonb-索引策略"},{"level":2,"text":"JSONB 修改操作","id":"jsonb-修改操作"},{"level":2,"text":"JSONB 聚合与分析","id":"jsonb-聚合与分析"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"DML 进阶操作","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/sql-language/analytical-sql/dml-advanced"},"next":{"title":"分析函数实战","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/sql-language/analytical-sql/analytical-patterns"}}